1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:05,220
Charlotte Brontë bet her
savings… on the AI of 1845.

2
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:07,250
It was called the railway.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,310
The technology that
would change everything.

4
00:00:10,310 --> 00:00:12,150
And everyone wanted in.

5
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,770
Charles Darwin bought shares.

6
00:00:13,770 --> 00:00:15,650
So did Charlotte and her sisters.

7
00:00:15,730 --> 00:00:20,080
Her shares cost 50 pounds…
and climbed to £120.

8
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:25,590
In 1846 alone, Parliament approved
4,500 miles of new track.

9
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:28,190
Nearly twice the railway
Britain already had.

10
00:00:28,390 --> 00:00:32,300
Then the new lines opened… and the
money didn't come in fast enough.

11
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,880
Prices crashed.

12
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:38,040
By 1849, Charlotte's shares
were worth… twenty pounds.

13
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:39,790
But here's the twist.

14
00:00:39,790 --> 00:00:41,250
The tracks stayed.

15
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:44,930
Almost every line kept running…
and Britain came out richer.

16
00:00:45,190 --> 00:00:46,570
Now look at AI.

17
00:00:46,570 --> 00:00:51,930
This year, Big Tech could spend 780
billion dollars on chips and data centres.

18
00:00:51,930 --> 00:00:55,400
By 2031: 1.5 trillion a year.

19
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:57,550
The consultants at Bain did the maths.

20
00:00:57,550 --> 00:01:01,620
To pay for that, AI must earn
nearly six trillion dollars a year.

21
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:03,420
Their best case for today's AI?

22
00:01:03,420 --> 00:01:05,060
1.8 trillion.

23
00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:10,280
That's a $4.2-trillion gap… to be
filled by things that barely exist yet.

24
00:01:10,340 --> 00:01:11,900
Bain doesn't call it a bubble.

25
00:01:11,900 --> 00:01:15,730
It says AI needs a wave of new
ideas… as big as the smartphone

26
00:01:15,730 --> 00:01:16,810
and the cloud.

27
00:01:16,990 --> 00:01:19,180
So maybe both things are true.

28
00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:22,980
Some investors lose a fortune…
and the world keeps the tracks.

29
00:01:23,090 --> 00:01:26,010
Follow for more AI, explained like this.
